OL,3,AAdidas sues Australian label White Fox
OL,4,Aover four stripes design
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fast-fashion online retailer is
OL,7,Fpopular with teenagers and young adults
OL,8,Fin Australia, the UK and the US, and
OL,9,Fhas relied on billboards, bus
OL,10,Fadvertising and influencers - often
OL,11,Funiversity-aged - to grow its profile.
OL,13,FThe Australian law firms representing
OL,14,FAdidas and White Fox both declined to
OL,15,Fcomment on the case, the first hearing
OL,16,Fdue to begin on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
